@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
title Dispute State Machine
[*] --> OPEN : Submit [owned COMPLETED transaction; no existing dispute]
OPEN --> UNDER_REVIEW : Claim [unassigned; one agent wins]
UNDER_REVIEW --> OPEN : Release [assigned agent; reason required]
UNDER_REVIEW --> ACCEPTED : Accept [assigned agent; both messages required]
UNDER_REVIEW --> REJECTED : Reject [assigned agent; both messages required]
ACCEPTED --> [*]
REJECTED --> [*]
note right of OPEN
No assigned agent
end note
note right of UNDER_REVIEW
Assigned to one agent
end note
note bottom of ACCEPTED
Terminal; resolving agent + assigned_at retained
Immutable; no automatic refund
Assignment never appears in customer responses
end note
@enduml
